            "target_entity_instance": "overestimation in CDNC",
            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "underestimating the surface area from large CCN overpredicts smax and the activation fraction hence the droplet concentration, especially for dg,2 > 0.5 \u00b5m (Fig. 1). This is in agreement with the results of Phinney et al. (2003) who showed that neglecting the effect of inertially-limited particles would result in an overestimation in CDNC (as opposed to assuming equilibrium conditions which results in underestimation of CDNC).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
