            "relation": "INHERITED_FROM",
            "target_entity_instance": "lognormal aerosol activation parameterization of Fountoukis and Nenes (2005)",
            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "The correction was incorporated into the Nenes and Seinfeld (2003) and Fountoukis and Nenes (2005) parameterizations and tested for a wide range of conditions. Results show that incorporation of the correction greatly improved the parameterization performance for conditions where inertially-limited CCN dominate droplet formation, without significant impact on the computational burden of the parameterization.",
